invariant: INV-14
file: webpki.c
catches: webpki_resume_test
reason: the leaf's subjectAltName is matched against the hostname only
  when the hello offered no ticket, so a server that declines a ticket
  may present a chain for any name. A declined ticket must get every
  check a handshake with no ticket gets (docs/decisions.md 55); the row
  that declines under other.example.test expects bad_certificate and
  objects.

--- old
    if (!webpki_match_san(leaf->san, leaf->san_len, cfg->hostname, cfg->hostname_len)) {
--- new
    if (cfg->psk == NULL &&
        !webpki_match_san(leaf->san, leaf->san_len, cfg->hostname, cfg->hostname_len)) {
